strengths.value:
1. This paper is well-written and well-organized;

2. The observation w.r.t. the new inliers and positive anchors seems interesting and correct;

3. The use of teacher-student networks is rational, and the design of Feature-Geometry Coherence Mining is novel.

4. The experimental results are strong on outdoor scenes.

